# Testing

- Vitest for Node; pytest for Python.
- Required: unit, integration, OpenAPI contract, event schema, auth, RBAC,
  tenant-isolation, idempotency, failure-recovery, e2e.
- Mandatory e2e: onboarding → catalogue → try-on → recommendations → analytics → dashboard.
- Explicitly mark mocked AI inference; never claim mock as real.
- Acceptance requires local startup without AWS credentials.
